[00:15.98]1. When our love is pure and intense,
[00:23.12]We make Jehovah’s heart rejoice.
[00:28.70]Love is his greatest quality,
[00:33.44]Something that we hold dear.
[00:39.78]Warm affection glows in our hearts,
[00:45.52]Making a loyal friendship grow.
[00:50.50]Love always acts unselfishly,
[00:55.30]Proving our love sincere.
[01:01.20]When we see a friend in need,
[01:06.82]We’ll be there to lend a helping hand.
[01:12.32]Truly we can be a friend,
[01:17.70]Someone who can understand.
[01:24.22]Jesus showed what love really means,
[01:29.40]Helping us see Jehovah’s love,
[01:34.20]Touching our hearts and moving us.
[01:39.92]Tender feelings are a start.
[01:45.10]Love intensely from the heart.
